<title>FINLAND: UPM HOLDS FINNYARDS NEWS CONFERENCE 1500.</title>
<headline>UPM HOLDS FINNYARDS NEWS CONFERENCE 1500.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish forest industry group UPM-Kymmene said in a statement it will hold a news conference on Thursday at 1500/1300 GMT concerning Finnyards, the troubled shipyard whose biggest owner it is.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0245</p>
